<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<!DOCTYPE plist PUBLIC "-//Apple//DTD PLIST 1.0//EN" "http://www.apple.com/DTDs/PropertyList-1.0.dtd">
<plist version="1.0">
    <dict>
        <key>Description</key>
        <string>Downloads the current Firefox for Windows (the EXE installer, 64-bit, en-US by default, of the channel in FIREFOX_CHANNEL) from Mozilla's download server and checks it against the SHA-256 that Mozilla's SHA256SUMS file gives for exactly that file. The current version is read from Mozilla's version file by its own processor (MozillaFirefoxInfoProvider, in this folder), because no shared recipe reads these two files. The file is stored under a name without spaces. The recipe never stops on an unchanged download, so a failed import is tried again at the next run. The layout of Mozilla's two files and of the installer's address was read from the servers on 2026-10-02 (the version file, the SHA256SUMS of one release, and a HEAD request for the installer); the recipe was NOT run with AutoPkg.</string>
        <key>Identifier</key>
        <string>com.github.serrc-techops.download.Firefox-Win</string>
        <key>Input</key>
        <dict>
            <key>NAME</key>
            <string>Firefox</string>
            <key>FIREFOX_CHANNEL</key>
            <string>release</string>
            <key>FIREFOX_PLATFORM</key>
            <string>win64</string>
            <key>FIREFOX_LOCALE</key>
            <string>en-US</string>
        </dict>
        <key>MinimumVersion</key>
        <string>1.0.0</string>
        <key>Process</key>
        <array>
            <dict>
                <key>Processor</key>
                <string>MozillaFirefoxInfoProvider</string>
                <key>Arguments</key>
                <dict>
                    <key>firefox_channel</key>
                    <string>%FIREFOX_CHANNEL%</string>
                    <key>firefox_platform</key>
                    <string>%FIREFOX_PLATFORM%</string>
                    <key>firefox_locale</key>
                    <string>%FIREFOX_LOCALE%</string>
                </dict>
            </dict>
            <dict>
                <key>Processor</key>
                <string>URLDownloader</string>
                <key>Arguments</key>
                <dict>
                    <key>filename</key>
                    <string>Firefox-Setup-%version%-%firefox_platform%-%firefox_locale%.exe</string>
                </dict>
            </dict>
            <dict>
                <key>Processor</key>
                <string>EndOfCheckPhase</string>
            </dict>
            <dict>
                <key>Processor</key>
                <string>com.github.serrc-techops.SharedProcessors/ChecksumVerifier</string>
                <key>Arguments</key>
                <dict>
                    <key>pathname</key>
                    <string>%pathname%</string>
                    <key>expected_sha256</key>
                    <string>%expected_sha256%</string>
                </dict>
            </dict>
        </array>
    </dict>
</plist>
